        },
        {
          "text": "Idwe luka Isirael kwape keiaar etiaikec, kes ikapolok luka ikekia luka lukapapaakee, ka ikapolok luka ilukumin ka luka akwatat, ka ikapolokokec luapotu kijaanakis ekabaka, kakiro kere nuka abeanakineta nuelomunete ka nuelomarete ŋclilap anatar ilapio kere luka ekaru, kaninibeikinet emwaasi ilukumin akaisaarei ka luonon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
